<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!-- Mechanism category — weapon has a Cut tool. Two trait families. "Edge" traits reshape the cut
       itself: Razored multiplies the blade's armor penetration (and nudges its damage), Monomolecular
       floors it at a monosword's for the weapon's quality, while Serrated reroutes the cut to a
       bleedier, scar-prone ragged wound. The "Core" token
       gates what the blade's core releases into the wound — currently only the Royalty-gated
       UMW_PlasmaCored's plasma burn; like Pointed's "Coating" it keeps any future infusion exclusive.
       Serrated additionally tags the cross-category "Ragged" token shared with Pointed's Barbed —
       the same tearing-wound concept per damage channel (Odyssey's ToxRounds/ToxPellets/AmmoType
       pattern), so a Bladed+Pointed weapon rolls at most one of them.
       Each token caps a weapon at one trait of its family, but an Edge and a Core trait can co-roll
       (a serrated plasma blade is legal). -->
  <WeaponCategoryDef>
    <defName>UMW_Bladed</defName>
    <label>bladed</label>
  </WeaponCategoryDef>

</Defs>
